  "description": "Konichiwa!\nThe Last Shuriken Rough is a new exploration of our best-selling Japanese display typeface, inspired by the raw beauty of traditional brush lettering. Featuring expressive dry-brush textures, distressed edges, and handcrafted ink strokes, it delivers a bold, authentic look influenced by Japanese calligraphy, vintage signage, and samurai culture.\nDesigned as an all-caps display font with stylistic alternates, The Last Shuriken Rough helps create natural, dynamic lettering with ease. Perfect for logos, branding, packaging, restaurant menus, posters, apparel, game titles, and social media, it brings handcrafted character and striking visual impact to every project.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Konichiwa!</p>\n<p>The Last Shuriken Rough is a new exploration of our best-selling Japanese display typeface, inspired by the raw beauty of traditional brush lettering. Featuring expressive dry-brush textures, distressed edges, and handcrafted ink strokes, it delivers a bold, authentic look influenced by Japanese calligraphy, vintage signage, and samurai culture.</p>\n<p>Designed as an all-caps display font with stylistic alternates, The Last Shuriken Rough helps create natural, dynamic lettering with ease. Perfect for logos, branding, packaging, restaurant menus, posters, apparel, game titles, and social media, it brings handcrafted character and striking visual impact to every project.</p>",
